%% System architecture — Sokoto Rainfall Cover
flowchart TB
    subgraph sources["Rainfall sources"]
        CHIRPS["CHIRPS<br/>(satellite + stations)"]
        NASA["NASA POWER<br/>(reanalysis)"]
        MET["Meteostat<br/>(station interpolation)"]
    end
    subgraph backend["Backend — Render"]
        API["REST API<br/>(sessions, roles, receipts)"]
        REL["Oracle relayer"]
        KEEP["Settlement keeper"]
        NOT["Notifier<br/>(in-app / SMS / Telegram)"]
    end
    subgraph frontend["React SPA — Cloudflare Pages"]
        FARM["Farmer portal"]
        AGENT["Agent portal"]
        ADMIN["Admin console<br/>(simulator, backtest)"]
    end
    subgraph chain["Ethereum Sepolia"]
        INS["WeatherIndexInsurance"]
        AGG["OracleAggregator"]
    end
    CHIRPS & NASA & MET -->|daily fetch| REL
    REL -->|signed reports| AGG
    AGG -->|finalized aggregates| INS
    KEEP -->|checkAndSettle| INS
    INS -->|events| NOT
    FARM & AGENT & ADMIN -->|same-origin /api, /auth| API
    FARM & AGENT & ADMIN -->|reads| INS & AGG
    FARM & AGENT & ADMIN -->|signed transactions via wallet| INS
    API -->|chain reads| INS & AGG
